            "scope": "children",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "group_heading",
                "num": "I",
                "text": "THE FOLLOWING SUBJECTS WHICH FALL WITHIN 'LIST 1 OF THE SEVENTH SCHED- ULE TO THE CONSTITUTION OF INDIA :"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "1",
                "text": "Maritime shipping and navigation; provision of education and training for the mercantile marine."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "2",
                "text": "Lighthouses and lightships."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "3",
                "text": "Administration of the Indian Ports Act, 1908, (15 of 1908) and Major Port Trusts Act, 1963 (38 of 1963) and ports declared as major ports."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "4",
                "text": "Compulsory insurance of motor vehicles. vi Administration of the Road Transport Corporations Act, 1950 (64 of 1950)."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "5",
                "text": "6. Highways declared by or under law made by Parliament to be national highways. 7 Shipping and navigation including carriage of passengers and goods on inland waterways declared by Parliament by law to be national waterways as regards mechanically propelled vessels, the rule of the road on such waterways."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "8",
                "text": "Ship-building and ship-repair industry."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "9",
                "text": "Fishing vessels industry."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "10",
                "text": "Floating craft industry."
              },
              {
                "type": "group_heading",
                "num": "II",
                "text": "IN RESPECT OF THE UNION TERRITORIES :"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "11",
                "text": "Roads other than National Highways."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "12",
                "text": "Tramways including elevated high speed trams within municipal limits or any other contiguous zone."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "13",
                "text": "Inland waterways and traffic thereon."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "14",
                "text": "Administration of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 (59 of 1988) and taxation of motor vehicles."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "15",
                "text": "Vehicles other than mechanically propelled vehicles."
              },
              {
                "type": "group_heading",
                "num": "IU",
                "text": "IN RESPECT OF THE UNION TERRITORIES OF THE ANDAMAN AND NICOBAR ISLANDS AND THE LAKSHADWEEP:"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "16",
                "text": "Organisation and maintenance of mainland islands and interislands shipping services."
              },
              {
                "type": "group_heading",
                "num": "IV",
                "text": "OTHER SUBJECTS WHICH HAVE NOT BEEN INCLUDED UNDER THE PREVIOUS SUB HEADS:"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "17",
                "text": "Central Road Fund."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "18",
                "text": "Coordination and Research pertaining to Road Works."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "19",
                "text": "Road works financed in whole or in part by the Central Government other than rural roads and the road works in the tribal areas in the states of Assam and Meghalaya specified in Parts I and II of the table appended to paragraph 20 of the Sixth Schedule to the Constitution. 22 Motor vehicles legislation."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "20",
                "text": "21. Legislation relating to shipping and navigation on inland waterways as regards mechanically propelled vessels and the carriage of passengers and goods on inland waterways. 10"
              },
              {
                "type": "part",
                "num": "II",
                "heading": "PART II",
                "text": "-SEC. 3(i)]"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "22",
                "text": "Planning of road and inland waterways transport. 23"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "23",
                "text": "Promotion of Transport Cooperatives in the field of motor transport and inland water transport."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "24",
                "text": "Development of townships of Gandhidham. 232 Legislation relating to and coordination of the development of minor and major ports."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "2",
                "text": "5. 26. Administration of the Dock Workers (Regulation of Employment) Act, 1948 (9 of 1948) and the Schemes framed thercunder other than the Dock Workers (Safety, Health and Welfare) Scheme, 1961."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "27",
                "text": "To make shipping arrangements for and on behalf of the Government of India /Public Sector Undertakings/State Governments/State Government Public Sector Undertakings and autonomous bodies in respect of import of cargo on FOB/FAS and export on C&F/CIF basis."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "28",
                "text": "Formulation of the privatisation policy in the infrastructure areas of ports, shipping, roads and inland waterways."
              },
              {
                "type": "group_heading",
                "num": "V",
                "text": "SUBORDINATE OFFICES :"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "29",
                "text": "Directorate General of Shipping."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "30",
                "text": "Andaman Lakshadweep Harbour Works."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "31",
                "text": "Directorate General of Lighthouses and Lightships."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "32",
                "text": "Minor Ports Survey Organisation."
              },
              {
                "type": "group_heading",
                "num": "VI",
                "text": "AUTONOMOUS BODIES :"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "33",
                "text": "Port Trusts at Mumbai, Calcutta, Kochi, Kandla, Chennai, Mormugao, Jawahar Lal Nehru 33 (Nhava Sheva), Paradip, Tuticorin, Visakhapatnam and New Mangalore."
              },
              {
